  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c4696b84-3899-4cfa-8ba5-21bee0208e4f"],
 ". Over a vertex ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " of the first base the numbering goes on, so no new vertex takes the name \
of an old one."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"735eb96c-929a-4866-b183-891efaabbd14"]
